OL,3,GNEWSATravel warning as 'oversized load'
OL,4,Adue on roads
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are being advised to expect
OL,7,Fdelays as an "oversized load" is moved.
OL,9,FSouth Yorkshire Police said it would be
OL,10,Fescorting a vehicle carrying a large
OL,11,Fcable drum from Brunton Shaw UK in
OL,12,FSandy Lane, Worksop, to Goole Docks
OL,13,Ffrom 19:00 GMT on Saturday.
OL,15,FAfter leaving Sandy Lane, the load will
OL,16,Ftravel down Gateford Road to the A57
OL,17,FWorksop Road, before travelling on the
OL,18,FM1, M18 and M62, then along the A161 to
OL,19,Fthe docks.
OL,21,FIt is expected to reach the docks
OL,22,Fbetween 04:00 and 05:00 on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
